# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Museion never commits content or binaries.
#
# A single "git add" of a ZIM or GGUF permanently bloats history and cannot be
# undone without rewriting every commit. These rules are load-bearing: if you
# add a new content or binary type, add it HERE FIRST, before you download it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Content archives (2-250 GB)
*.zim
*.zim.*
*.zimaa
*.pmtiles
*.mbtiles

# Models (1-40 GB)
*.gguf
*.gguf.*
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.onnx

# Downloaded sidecar binaries (kiwix-serve, llama-server)
/bin/
/vendor/
*.exe
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so
*.so.*

# Default library / download locations, if anyone points them inside the repo
/library/
/downloads/
*.part
*.partial
*.download

# Archives that content and binaries arrive in
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.tgz
*.7z

# Generated indexes (rebuilt from content; never source of truth)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Toolchain output
node_modules/
target/
dist/
build/
.vite/

# Local machine state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.json
/config.local.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
